<h1 class="heading">Event Booking Approved</h1>

<p class="text">
  Hi {@event.registrant_full_name}, we're pleased to inform you that your event booking request has been approved.
</p>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">
    {@event.occassion}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Type:</span>
    {@event.event_type.display_name}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Date:</span>
    {format_date_range(@event.start, @event.end)}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Time:</span>
    {Calendar.strftime(@event.start, "%I:%M %p")} - {Calendar.strftime(@event.end, "%I:%M %p")}
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">Reference Number</p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Event ID:</span>
    {@event.id}
  </p>

  <p class="small-text">
    Please include this reference number in any communications about your event.
  </p>
</div>

<p class="text">
  To complete your booking, please proceed with the payment by clicking the button below:
</p>

<a href={@payment_url} class="button">Complete Payment</a>

<div style="background-color: #fefce8; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; border-radius: 0.375rem; padding: 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0;">
  <p style="color: #a16207; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 0;">
    Important: The remaining balance must be paid in full on the day of the event.
  </p>
</div>

<p class="text">
  If you need to make any changes or have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us.
</p>

<p class="text italic" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
  Please note: This inbox is not monitored. If you have questions, contact our support team directly.
</p>

<div class="footer">
  <img
    src="https://singhsabha.net/images/logo.png"
    alt="Singh Sabha Logo"
    class="logo"
  />
  <p>
    <a href="https://singhsabha.net/" target="_blank">SinghSabha.net</a>, serving the Sikh community with devotion and compassion.
  </p>
</div>
